        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also design, install and maintain gamma irradiation systems, which include radiation shielding, a series of conveyors and control systems that are designed to expose products to the correct gamma radiation dosage in a safe and efficient manner.",
